{"version":1,"content":"<p>太平洋正在形成一場可能打破1997年歷史紀錄的超強厄爾尼諾事件。美國國家航空航天局（NASA）正在利用衞星持續監測海洋變化。最新觀測顯示，2026年的海洋狀況與1997—1998年那場著名的強厄爾尼諾事件存在明顯相似之處，但科學家強調，海洋信號相似並不意味着全球天氣一定會完全重演。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585946.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:17:02.068547+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:58:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:23.683286+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:23.683286+00:00","content_hash":"748aebc83070aa0aacda33564e9dce6b31c1c21fb3db8c27184bae32c39b3407","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}